      "message": "The ABI is broken with these patches. These CRC issues must be resolved. These are probably caused by changing visibility of some KMI frozen structure. The most common case is `trace_eval_map` becoming fully visible by the addition of the hook definition header. If that is the issue, you can fix it with:\n```\nANDROID_KABI_DECLONLY(trace_eval_map);\n```\nafter the header inclusion. If that doesn\u0027t resolve it, then follow the instructions at https://source.android.com/docs/core/architecture/kernel/abi-monitor#fixing-crc-mismatch\n\n```\nfunction symbol \u0027int usb_autopm_get_interface(struct usb_interface*)\u0027 changed\n  CRC changed from 0x7ff89012 to 0x2be4fa00\n\nfunction symbol \u0027int usb_autopm_get_interface_async(struct usb_interface*)\u0027 changed\n  CRC changed from 0x7ff89012 to 0x2be4fa00\n\nfunction symbol \u0027void usb_autopm_get_interface_no_resume(struct usb_interface*)\u0027 changed\n  CRC changed from 0x587ff1ff to 0xde516a23\n\n```",
